{"product_id":"blvk-nic-salt-havana-tobacco","title":"BLVK Nic Salt - Havana Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eIndulge in the rich and bold flavor of Havana Tobacco Nic Salt by BLVK 30ml. This premium nicotine salt captures the essence of traditional Cuban tobacco, offering a deep, earthy flavor with subtle sweetness. Whether you’re transitioning from cigarettes or enjoy classic tobacco notes, Havana Tobacco delivers an authentic experience with smooth, satisfying hits.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBLVK Nic Salt Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBLVK Tobacco Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\/50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted for Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarning: This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in vape pod system and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41806978514999,"sku":"BLVK - Havana Tobacco - 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41806978547767,"sku":"BLVK - Havana Tobacco - 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk-nic-salt-havana-tobacco.webp?v=1754244585","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/blvk-nic-salt-havana-tobacco","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




